## What exists

| Path | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `vectorops/__init__.py` | `dotproduct(a, b)` re-exported at package root; `__version__ = "0.1.0"` |
| `pyproject.toml` | setuptools build backend, `name = "vectorops"`, `version = "0.1.0"` |
| `dist/vectorops-0.1.0-py3-none-any.whl`, `…tar.gz` | built with `python3 -m build` |
| `pypi_server.py` | dependency-free PEP 503 "simple" index on port 8080 (`/simple/`, `/simple/vectorops/` with `#sha256=` fragments, `/packages/<file>`, `/health`) |
| `run_server.sh` | idempotent start/restart, writes pid + log to `.gnomon-jobs/` |
| `tests/` | 21 tests: `test_dotproduct.py` (contract from the docstring, not the body) and `test_pypi_server.py` |
| `verify.sh` | turns every stated constraint into a command that fails if violated |

The server is **live now** (pid 7036) and will keep serving; restart it any time with `./run_server.sh`.

